<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean pro-soccer</p>
<p>games played on Thursday.</p>
<p> Pohang	3    Ulsan	 2   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p> Puchon	2    Chonbuk     1   (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Thursday (tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Puchon		3     1    0     6     1    10</p>
<p> Chonan		3     0    1    13    10     9</p>
<p> Pohang		2     1    1    11    10     7</p>
<p> Suwan		 1     3    0     7     3     6</p>
<p> Ulsan		 1     0    2     8     9     3</p>
<p> Anyang		0     3    1     6     9     3</p>
<p> Chonnam	     0     2    1     4     5     2</p>
<p> Pusan		 0     2    1     3     7     2</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     0     0    3     3     7     0</p>
</text>
